  "topic": "开团整备韩信",
  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "doc-e14b8afe57e662a455be8a",
      "section": "前期运营及应变",
      "text": "上场狂铁 + 弈星打工。姜导技能「钦定主角」先给狂铁，不使用刷新，攒经济升级。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-1696d0dab3b8f81d2f4efb44b57d0e2c8f70abb484f879b9f6b08e6fee6b8a63",
          "paragraph_start": 27,
          "paragraph_end": 27
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-0d23374e2290a12868e917",
      "section": "前期运营及应变",
      "text": "第一轮拍卖优先级：云中君＞瑶，没有就拿带开团/整备词条的卡。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-1696d0dab3b8f81d2f4efb44b57d0e2c8f70abb484f879b9f6b08e6fee6b8a63",
          "paragraph_start": 28,
          "paragraph_end": 28
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-27ddf37642023c59b1cd45",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "韩信上场后，还没有解锁封神一瞬可以从商店购买简易协作等提升等级的效果牌，帮助韩信升到25级，触发秘技封神一瞬，直接获得等级。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-1696d0dab3b8f81d2f4efb44b57d0e2c8f70abb484f879b9f6b08e6fee6b8a63",
          "paragraph_start": 17,
          "paragraph_end": 17
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-0d0d9cbd932a998696cc9b",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "想多养一个输出，可以把狂铁换成孙悟空，刷到太乙真人可以先不上，先上孙悟空，孙悟空带有整备效果，还能给闪现的英雄加等级，韩信等级增加会更快。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-1696d0dab3b8f81d2f4efb44b57d0e2c8f70abb484f879b9f6b08e6fee6b8a63",
          "paragraph_start": 18,
          "paragraph_end": 18
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-f3c5557eb1158603a349f0",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "这套阵容越早凑齐阵容中的牌，后期提升的等级越高，天赋可以选择找牌类的天赋，帮助阵容成型。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-1696d0dab3b8f81d2f4efb44b57d0e2c8f70abb484f879b9f6b08e6fee6b8a63",
          "paragraph_start": 19,
          "paragraph_end": 19
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-9dff6bb5eec3c07695b554",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "棋手升到4级，开始搜韩信，韩信没来之前所有卡最多只拿一张。找到韩信后，立刻把钦定主角转移给韩信，韩信升到25级，自动触发秘技【封神一瞬】，直接获得等级。场上慢慢补齐亚连、雅典娜、云中君、瑶、太乙。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-1696d0dab3b8f81d2f4efb44b57d0e2c8f70abb484f879b9f6b08e6fee6b8a63",
          "paragraph_start": 30,
          "paragraph_end": 30
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-e4eeac14d4e5d3710863ab",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "阵容卡全了以后将棋手升到五级。优先觉醒韩信，亚连、云中君来了可以顺手觉醒；雅典娜不用觉醒。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-1696d0dab3b8f81d2f4efb44b57d0e2c8f70abb484f879b9f6b08e6fee6b8a63",
          "paragraph_start": 32,
          "paragraph_end": 32
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-123248a5ac0546ab5a979b",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "棋手升到6级，韩信获得高额吸血强化和免控。后期操作：每回合打满手牌继续堆等级。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-1696d0dab3b8f81d2f4efb44b57d0e2c8f70abb484f879b9f6b08e6fee6b8a63",
          "paragraph_start": 34,
          "paragraph_end": 34
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-4ebf099a199f46d519faff",
      "section": "核心机制",
      "text": "依靠高频触发开团+整备配合姜导秘技「封神一瞬」疯狂堆叠韩信等级，百级之后全程击飞控到死，专杀各类单核大C。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "mechanic",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-1696d0dab3b8f81d2f4efb44b57d0e2c8f70abb484f879b9f6b08e6fee6b8a63",
          "paragraph_start": 2,
          "paragraph_end": 2
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-d3a44d5bd2676024f3a3d8",
      "section": "核心机制",
      "text": "韩信【主 C】：触发开团、整备就永久涨等级；觉醒后每次+ 4等级，高等级无限击飞冲锋收割。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "mechanic",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-1696d0dab3b8f81d2f4efb44b57d0e2c8f70abb484f879b9f6b08e6fee6b8a63",
          "paragraph_start": 8,
          "paragraph_end": 8
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-f8fd4cd29ceacd82e3e7f2",
      "section": "核心机制",
      "text": "亚连：整备，给场上装备最多英雄（韩信）额外等级加成。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "mechanic",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-1696d0dab3b8f81d2f4efb44b57d0e2c8f70abb484f879b9f6b08e6fee6b8a63",
          "paragraph_start": 9,
          "paragraph_end": 9
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-c48946f817bec4e6379025",
      "section": "核心机制",
      "text": "雅典娜：开团，战斗内再次触发亚连整备，一回合多次给韩信叠级。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "mechanic",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-1696d0dab3b8f81d2f4efb44b57d0e2c8f70abb484f879b9f6b08e6fee6b8a63",
          "paragraph_start": 10,
          "paragraph_end": 10
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-e582cefc09fb764e1b7490",
      "section": "核心机制",
      "text": "云中君：韩信穿戴装备，加等级。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "mechanic",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-1696d0dab3b8f81d2f4efb44b57d0e2c8f70abb484f879b9f6b08e6fee6b8a63",
          "paragraph_start": 11,
          "paragraph_end": 11
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-f56576a1546d0f1a681643",
      "section": "核心机制",
      "text": "瑶：开团附身韩信，保护和控制。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "mechanic",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-1696d0dab3b8f81d2f4efb44b57d0e2c8f70abb484f879b9f6b08e6fee6b8a63",
          "paragraph_start": 12,
          "paragraph_end": 12
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-3a322a3cec31bf8d56b8d6",
      "section": "核心机制",
      "text": "太乙真人：开团词条，给韩信挂复活。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "mechanic",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-1696d0dab3b8f81d2f4efb44b57d0e2c8f70abb484f879b9f6b08e6fee6b8a63",
          "paragraph_start": 13,
          "paragraph_end": 13
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-1fa3ef5dd9da3af3612c30",
      "section": "核心机制",
      "text": "狂铁，孙悟空，朵莉亚，张良等其他整备开团卡，给韩信加等级。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "mechanic",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-1696d0dab3b8f81d2f4efb44b57d0e2c8f70abb484f879b9f6b08e6fee6b8a63",
          "paragraph_start": 14,
          "paragraph_end": 14
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-86af1f947f6bd7ae51c610",
      "section": "关键效果牌",
      "text": "能触发整备效果的牌，临阵磨枪、全军动员等，有多少拿多少，还有露娜，可以更快的提升韩信等级。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-1696d0dab3b8f81d2f4efb44b57d0e2c8f70abb484f879b9f6b08e6fee6b8a63",
          "paragraph_start": 20,
          "paragraph_end": 20
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-a49e8f192af886ca47d02f",
      "section": "关键效果牌",
      "text": "可以配合姜子牙的词条效果，使用不在场阵营的整备牌作为打出位触发等级提升，配合棋手姜导封神一瞬的效果频繁提升主要输出英雄等级。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-1696d0dab3b8f81d2f4efb44b57d0e2c8f70abb484f879b9f6b08e6fee6b8a63",
          "paragraph_start": 21,
          "paragraph_end": 21
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-f2aaf5dd7f316289ede758",
      "section": "推荐装备",
      "text": "韩信：铸梦・逐风（鸡爪） + 自然法杖（变猪法杖）+ 名刀司命；神器优先级：末世/百锻刀。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-1696d0dab3b8f81d2f4efb44b57d0e2c8f70abb484f879b9f6b08e6fee6b8a63",
          "paragraph_start": 23,
